VPLL configuration register 1. Reset 0x0100102E = integer mode, refdiv 1, fbdiv 0x2E = 46 -> VCO 24 x 46 = 1104 MHz, POSTDIV (/2) = 552 MHz (Fig. 3-3). The VPLL PST and FOUT4 outputs are VDP clock sources (PERI_CRG66 vdp_hd_cksel).

Data sheet 3.2.6 PERI_CRG_PLL7 (offset 0x1C, printed page 3-15, `hi3516av300--Hi3516AV300-Datasheet.txt` line 6915).";

        enum PERI_CRG_PLL7_vpll_bypass_enum {
