        name = "AIAO MCLK2 clock configuration register";
        desc = "AIAO MCLK2 clock configuration register.

AIAO MCLK2 divider. Reset 0x001FFFFF; the 27-bit divider field resets to 0x1FFFFF and the gate to off. The data sheet gives the formula but not the source clock of the divider (low confidence on its reference).

